in="00:20.416" end="00:20.617">little </span><span begin="00:20.617" end="00:21.218">tonight </span><span begin="00:21.218" end="00:21.919">（uh </span><span begin="00:21.919" end="00:22.417">uh）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.119" end="00:24.823"><span begin="00:22.119" end="00:22.620">Cuz </span><span begin="00:22.620" end="00:23.571">everybodys </span><span begin="00:23.571" end="00:24.072">making </span><span begin="00:24.072" end="00:24.816">trouble</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.523" end="00:26.675"><span begin="00:24.523" end="00:25.424">Someones </span><span begin="00:25.424" end="00:25.724">burst </span><span begin="00:25.724" end="00:26.175">their </span><span begin="00:26.175" end="00:26.669">bubble</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.375" end="00:31.883"><span begin="00:26.375" end="00:26.927">But </span><span begin="00:26.927" end="00:27.176">well </span><span begin="00:27.176" end="00:27.427">be </span><span begin="00:27.427" end="00:27.627">getting </span><span begin="00:27.627" end="00:27.877">by </span><span begin="00:27.877" end="00:28.428">alright </span><span begin="00:28.428" end="00:29.129">（uh </span><span begin="00:29.129" end="00:29.530">uh </span><span begin="00:29.530" end="00:31.879">uh）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.087" end="00:37.191"><span begin="00:34.087" end="00:34.787">Sooner </span><span begin="00:34.787" end="00:35.037">or </span><span begin="00:35.037" end="00:35.589">later </span><span begin="00:35.589" end="00:35.889">this </span><span begin="00:35.889" end="00:36.490">drunken </span><span begin="00:36.490" end="00:37.186">elevator</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.241" end="00:40.846"><span begin="00:37.241" end="00:37.841">Is </span><span begin="00:37.841" end="00:38.042">gonna </span><span begin="00:38.042" end="00:38.442">stop </span><span begin="00:38.442" end="00:38.693">where </span><span begin="00:38.693" end="00:38.993">i'm </span><span begin="00:38.993" end="00:39.544">suppo