00:54.366" end="00:54.763">pay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.068" end="00:57.823"><span begin="00:56.068" end="00:56.819">Loves </span><span begin="00:56.819" end="00:57.019">gonna </span><span begin="00:57.019" end="00:57.319">get </span><span begin="00:57.319" end="00:57.823">cha</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.523" end="00:59.674"><span begin="00:57.523" end="00:58.021">But </span><span begin="00:58.021" end="00:58.474">only </span><span begin="00:58.474" end="00:58.722">when </span><span begin="00:58.722" end="00:58.972">i </span><span begin="00:58.972" end="00:59.272">let </span><span begin="00:59.272" end="00:59.668">cha</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.374" end="01:02.377"><span begin="00:59.374" end="00:59.923">And </span><span begin="00:59.923" end="01:00.174">i </span><span begin="01:00.174" end="01:00.624">don't </span><span begin="01:00.624" end="01:00.875">wanna </span><span begin="01:00.875" end="01:01.375">turn </span><span begin="01:01.375" end="01:02.371">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.277" end="01:05.281"><span begin="01:02.277" end="01:02.928">Why </span><span begin="01:02.928" end="01:03.328">can't </span><span begin="01:03.328" end="01:03.829">the </span><span begin="01:03.829" end="01:04.279">boys </span><span begin="01:04.279" end="01:04.530">see </span><span begin="01:04.530" end="01:04.730">the </span><span begin="01:04.730" end="01:05.277">toys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.981" end="01:08.736"><span begin="01:04.981" end="01:05.381">And </span><span begin="01:05.381" end="01:05.631">the </span><span begin="01:05.631" end="01:06.132">girls </span><span begin="01:06.132" end="01:06.333">want </span><span begin="01:06.333" end="01:06.533">the </span><span begin="01:06.533" end="01:06.983">boys </span><span begin="01:06.983" end="01:07.437">to </span><span begin="01:07.437" end="01:08.735">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.559" end="01:12.613"><span begin="01:09.559" end="01:10.06