an></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.932" end="01:27.585"><span begin="01:24.932" end="01:25.532">Cuz </span><span begin="01:25.532" end="01:25.782">everybodys </span><span begin="01:25.782" end="01:26.784">making </span><span begin="01:26.784" end="01:27.578">trouble</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.285" end="01:29.387"><span begin="01:27.285" end="01:28.186">Someones </span><span begin="01:28.186" end="01:28.536">burst </span><span begin="01:28.536" end="01:28.737">their </span><span begin="01:28.737" end="01:29.381">bubble</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.087" end="01:33.193"><span begin="01:29.087" end="01:29.688">But </span><span begin="01:29.688" end="01:29.988">well </span><span begin="01:29.988" end="01:30.189">be </span><span begin="01:30.189" end="01:30.439">getting </span><span begin="01:30.439" end="01:30.689">by </span><span begin="01:30.689" end="01:31.791">alright </span><span begin="01:31.791" end="01:32.141">（uh </span><span begin="01:32.141" end="01:32.642">uh </span><span begin="01:32.642" end="01:33.191">uh）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.212" end="01:35.465"><span begin="01:33.212" end="01:34.063">At </span><span begin="01:34.063" end="01:34.264">night </span><span begin="01:34.264" end="01:34.467">its </span><span begin="01:34.467" end="01:34.664">on </span><span begin="01:34.664" end="01:35.015">the </span><span begin="01:35.015" end="01:35.461">low</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.165" end="01:37.318"><span begin="01:35.165" end="01:35.665">No </span><span begin="01:35.665" end="01:36.066">front </span><span begin="01:36.066" end="01:36.266">just </span><span begin="01:36.266" end="01:36.517">sing </span><span begin="01:36.517" end="01:36.717">the </span><span begin="01:36.717" end="01:37.313">flow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.018" end="01:39.170"><span begin="01:37.018" end="01:37.518">Were </span><span begin="01:37.518" end="01:37.768">speaking </span><span begin="01:37.768" end="01:38.219">all